---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About
permalink: /about/
description: "John Carl Dimatulac, full-stack developer and WordPress and automation engineer based in Laguna, Philippines."
---
{%- from "partials/rd-pagehead.njk" import pagehead -%}
{%- from "partials/rd-icons.njk" import icon -%}
{% call pagehead({
  badge: 'About John Carl',
  titleHtml: 'Technical depth. <span class="signal">Operational perspective.</span>',
  sub: "I'm a full-stack web developer and WordPress &amp; automation engineer based in Sta. Rosa, Laguna, Philippines."
}) %}<div class="rd-actions"><a class="rd-btn rd-btn--white" href="/resume/">View my resume<span class="rd-btn__chip">{{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></a>{% if site.resumeUrl %}<a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="{{ site.resumeUrl }}" download>Download PDF {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a>{% endif %}<a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/carl-dimatulac">LinkedIn {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a></div>{% endcall %}
<div class="rd-wrap rd-stage"><figure class="portrait rd-portrait" data-enter><img src="{{ site.portrait }}" alt="{{ site.owner }}" width="1200" height="1200" decoding="async"><figcaption class="label label--plain label--faint">{{ site.owner }} — {{ site.location }}</figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="shell portfolio-section about-story"><h2>Connecting the work<br>behind the website.</h2><div><p>I build applications, custom WordPress tools, and automation pipelines. My projects span security services, logistics demos, education, and content publishing.</p><p>Experience supporting construction IT and office networks gives me a practical view of how people use technology day to day. I carry that perspective into the interfaces and systems I develop.</p></div></section>
<section class="shell portfolio-section"><h2>Experience</h2><div class="career-list">{% for job in career %}<article><p class="project-type">{{ job.date }}</p><div><h3>{{ job.title }}</h3><p class="career-company">{{ job.company }}</p><ul>{% for point in job.points %}<li>{{ point }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="shell portfolio-section capabilities"><h2>Tools I work with.</h2><div class="capability-list"><article><h3>Frontend</h3><p>React, Next.js, Vue, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, GSAP</p></article><article><h3>Backend & data</h3><p>Node.js, Express, PHP, PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Firebase, Drizzle ORM</p></article><article><h3>WordPress & automation</h3><p>Custom themes and plugins, REST APIs, n8n, OpenRouter, NVIDIA AI APIs</p></article><article><h3>Deployment</h3><p>Vercel, Railway, Cloudflare, GCP Cloud Run, GitHub Actions</p></article></div></section>{% include "partials/studio-contact.njk" %}
